# Normalise line endings: LF in the repo, LF in the working tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Hunting queries and IOC lists are markdown. The KQL lives in fenced blocks
# inside these pages, so there is no query file type to declare separately —
# see docs/query-format.md for the structure a page is expected to follow.
*.md text eol=lf

# Issue forms and any workflow definitions, parsed by GitHub on Linux.
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# The ATT&CK Navigator layer, read as JSON by navigator.mitre.org.
*.json text eol=lf

# Demo page, its poster and the coverage artwork.
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf

# Binaries — explicit, so nothing depends on git's content sniffing. The demo
# capture is the only one tracked today; the raster entries are here so a proof
# screenshot dropped into docs/img/ later is never line-ending normalised.
*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
